class_name VectorArt
extends PaintedArt
## Flat-vector desert visuals for lane G-C (docs/bakeoff/desert-biome-brief.md, SVG kit): the same eleven slots as
## PaintedArt, filled with hand-written SVGs (art/*.svg) that Godot rasterizes at their viewBox size. Tiles, crystals
## with the reveal shader, orb, gate, hazard spikes and the three parallax layers are placed exactly as PaintedArt
## places them. The character is GreyboxArt's STAND-IN capsule: G-C is environment-only. THROWAWAY.
